    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d361">

                <pb facs="0443" n="431" sameAs="frus:frus1942v01/pg431"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">701.0090/361a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1942-06-12">June 12, 1942</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1521. Please inform Swiss Foreign Office and ask that Swiss Minister and Grew,
                    Tokyo, be also informed Department regrets state departure exchange vessel <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gripsholm</hi> delayed account of failure receive
                    Japanese list American nationals coming from China and because <pb facs="0444"
                        n="432" xml:id="pg432"/> Japanese Government refused give safe conduct <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Gripsholm</hi> until June 16. Hope these difficulties
                    will be settled and vessel will proceed on June 17.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
